    alt       nu_RAR: r_M = 0.0352 pc; quadrupole needs f(r_M/l) < 0.147 -> l > 0.0522 pc (shell to 3 r_M: l > 0.157 pc); Galactic eta needs f(R_0/l) > 0.9 -> l < 2.11e+03 pc = 2.11 kpc
