           (l_max = 2.11 kpc)
  [PASS] 2c THE WINDOW IS OPEN for the quadrature structure: l_max/l_min(conservative) > 1 on every footing and kernel -- unlike SW03's smoothed-total-switch, where SW04 found none (PPN l <= 0.001 pc vs quadrupole l >= 0.1 pc)
           (min l_max/l_min3 = 1.25e+04 (about four orders of magnitude: l in [~0.2 pc, ~2 kpc]); MUTATE: closed)

